{'symbol': 'ALLE', 'date': '2023-02-09 17:00:00', 'title': "ALLEGION'S BOARD INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND BY 10%", 'text': "DUBLIN--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ALLEGION PLC (NYSE: ALLE), A LEADING GLOBAL SECURITY PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.45 PER ORDINARY SHARE OF THE COMPANY – REPRESENTING A 10-PERCENT INCREASE FROM 2022 AND THE COMPANY'S NINTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR OF ANNUAL INCREASE IN DIVIDENDS."}